{"id":"23952280bf6281f76a8e813f144f19295092b177","axis":"silent","repo":"TryGhost/Ghost","sha":"23952280bf6281f76a8e813f144f19295092b177","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/koenig-read-only-controls.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"@tryghost/koenig-lexical\": patch","+---","+","+Fixed the editor's own controls staying live in a read-only editor. With Lexical's editable flag off on the top-level editor, the format toolbar, card menus and pickers are not shown, no card can be selected, edited, inserted, deleted or dragged, cards take no pointer or click input, no keys other than Ctrl/Cmd shortcuts and Tab, no file from a dialog opened earlier and no new focus, placing the cursor no longer triggers text shortcuts, and anything dropped on the document is refused, while text, including text in cards, can still be selected and copied. A picker or field a card had open stays closed once the editor is editable again, other than the Unsplash and GIF selectors. Also fixed the Cmd/Ctrl+K link shortcut leaving a stale handler behind when a format toolbar unmounts."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/README.md","lines":["@@ -54,6 +54,64 @@ The main module source. `/src/index.js` is the entry point for the exposed modul"," "," Used for developing/demoing the editor. Renders a blank editor with all features enabled."," ","+### Read-only","+","+Lexical's editable flag on the top-level editor is the one switch. An app makes","+the editor read-only with `setEditable(false)` on the editor instance it gets","+from `registerAPI`, and editable again with `setEditable(true)`. While the flag","+is off the document can be read, selected and copied, and nothing the reader","+does in the editor changes it:","+","+- typing, pasting and dropping do nothing. Lexical ignores its own input","+  events, and Koenig refuses the rest: input the browser would still apply in","+  the moment before the change is rendered, and anything dropped on the","+  document, which is also kept from the browser so a dropped link or file is","+  not opened","+- placing the cursor rewrites nothing. The text shortcuts for dashes, dividers","+  and the paywall, and the tidying of an unfinished link search, wait for the","+  next change once the editor is editable again","+- the format and link toolbars, the plus and slash card menus, and the emoji,","+  link search, Unsplash, GIF and video thumbnail pickers are not rendered,","+  including one that was open when the flag went off. The image editor is a","+  window of its own and stays open, but what it saves is refused","+- no card is selected or in edit mode, and none can be selected, edited,","+  inserted, deleted or dragged. A card that was open is closed, a drag under","+  way is abandoned, and an empty card is not removed, since that would change","+  the document","+- a card takes no pointer input and no new focus, and a control in it that","+  already had focus gets no keys or clicks, so its own buttons, links, inputs","+  and media controls do nothing. Shortcuts with Ctrl or Cmd pass untouched to","+  the browser and the app, and Tab still moves focus, so text can be copied and","+  focus can leave the card. A card's text is still part of a selection drawn","+  across it, of find-in-page and of the accessibility tree","+- a file chosen in a file dialog that was opened before the flag went off is","+  not taken","+- a picker, link field or name field a card had open is closed for good, not","+  shown again when the editor is editable. Link search results are offered","+  again with the editor's next change, if the cursor is still in the search.","+  The Unsplash and GIF selectors are the exception: each is all there is of","+  its card until an image is chosen, so it is shown again","+","+The flag does not cover:","+","+- updates the app makes itself, with `editor.update()` or the API it gets from","+  `registerAPI`, such as `insertParagraphAtTop`. Lexical allows those in a","+  read-only editor. `insertFiles` is the exception: it inserts cards, which is","+  refused","+- work a card had already started, such as fetching a bookmark or picking a","+  colour from the screen, which fills the card in when it finishes","+- links in the text. They are ordinary links in a read-only document and open","+  when clicked","+","+A card's nested editor has an editable flag of its own, which in most cards","+follows the card's edit mode. Lexical copies the top-level flag to every nested","+editor when it changes, so those cards put their editors back once the editor","+is editable again: a card that is not being edited stays closed.","+","+The `readOnly` prop is a different, narrower thing: it only turns off drag","+reordering and adds a `readonly` attribute to the content element. It does not","+set the flag, and the editor can still be typed in.","+"," ### Styling"," "," **CSS**"],"additions":58,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/src/components/KoenigCardWrapper.tsx","lines":["@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@ import {$isKoenigCard} from '@tryghost/kg-default-nodes';"," import {CardWrapper} from './ui/CardWrapper';"," import {EDIT_CARD_COMMAND, SELECT_CARD_COMMAND, SHOW_CARD_VISIBILITY_SETTINGS_COMMAND} from '../plugins/KoenigBehaviourPlugin';"," import {cardHasEditMode, isCardVisibilityAvailable} from '../utils/visibility';","+import {isDocumentEditable, useIsDocumentEditable} from '../hooks/useIsDocumentEditable';"," import {mergeRegister} from '@lexical/utils';"," import {useKoenigSelectedCardContext} from '../context/KoenigSelectedCardContext';"," import {useLexicalComposerContext} from '@lexical/react/LexicalComposerContext';","@@ -29,10 +30,50 @@ const KoenigCardWrapper = ({nodeKey, width, wrapperStyle, IndicatorIcon, childre","     const skipClick = React.useRef(false);"," ","     const {selectedCardKey, isEditingCard, isDragging} = useKoenigSelectedCardContext();","+    const isReadOnly = !useIsDocumentEditable();"," ","     const isSelected = selectedCardKey === nodeKey;","     const isEditing = isSelected && isEditingCard;"," ","+    // the stylesheet takes the pointer from a read-only card, and new focus is refused here. Not","+    // `inert`, which would also keep its text out of selections, find-in-page and screen readers","+    const refuseFocus = React.useCallback((event) => {","+        event.target.blur?.();","+    }, []);","+","+    // a control that had focus keeps it, so its keys and the clicks they make are refused. Shortcuts","+    // pass once the card is no longer selected: until that renders, its editing controls would take them","+    const refuseInput = React.useCallback((event) => {","+        if (isDocumentEditable(editor) || !event.currentTarget.contains(event.target)) {","+            return;","+        }","+","+        const isShortcut = event.ctrlKey || event.metaKey || ['Shift', 'Control', 'Alt', 'Meta'].includes(event.key);","+        if (event.type !== 'click' && isShortcut && !isSelected) {","+            return;","+        }","+","+        event.stopPropagation();","+","+        if (event.key !== 'Tab') {","+            event.preventDefault();","+        }","+    }, [editor, isSelected]);","+","+    // a file chosen in a dialog that was opened before the document went read-only is not taken,","+    // nor kept by the input, which would not report the same file chosen again","+    const refuseChange = React.useCallback((event) => {","+        if (isDocumentEditable(editor) || !event.currentTarget.contains(event.target)) {","+            return;","+        }","+","+        event.stopPropagation();","+","+        if (event.target.type === 'file') {","+            event.target.value = '';","+        }","+    }, [editor]);","+","     const handleVisibilityToggle = React.useCallback((event) => {","         event.preventDefault();","         event.stopPropagation();","@@ -200,6 +241,7 @@ const KoenigCardWrapper = ({nodeKey, width, wrapperStyle, IndicatorIcon, childre","                 ref={containerRef}","                 cardType={cardType}","                 cardWidth={width}","+                data-kg-read-only={isReadOnly ? '' : undefined}","                 feature={cardConfig?.feature}","                 IndicatorIcon={IndicatorIcon}","                 isDragging={isDragging}","@@ -207,7 +249,12 @@ const KoenigCardWrapper = ({nodeKey, width, wrapperStyle, IndicatorIcon, childre","                 isSelected={isSelected}","                 isVisibilityActive={isVisibilityActive}","                 wrapperStyle={wrapperStyle}","+                onChangeCapture={refuseChange}","+                onClickCapture={refuseInput}","+                onFocusCapture={isReadOnly ? refuseFocus : undefined}","                 onIndicatorClick={handleVisibilityToggle}","+                onKeyDownCapture={refuseInput}","+                onKeyUpCapture={refuseInput}","             >","                 {children}","             </CardWrapper>"],"additions":47,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/src/components/KoenigComposableEditor.tsx","lines":["@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ import {OnChangePlugin} from '@lexical/react/LexicalOnChangePlugin';"," import {RestrictContentPlugin} from '../index.js';"," import {RichTextPlugin} from '@lexical/react/LexicalRichTextPlugin';"," import {useCollaborationContext} from '@lexical/react/LexicalCollaborationContext';","+import {useIsDocumentEditable} from '../hooks/useIsDocumentEditable';"," import {useLexicalComposerContext} from '@lexical/react/LexicalComposerContext';"," import {useSharedHistoryContext} from '../context/SharedHistoryContext';"," import {useSharedOnChangeContext} from '../context/SharedOnChangeContext';","@@ -49,6 +50,8 @@ const KoenigComposableEditor = ({","     const [editor] = useLexicalComposerContext();","     const {isCollabActive} = useCollaborationContext();","     const {editorContainerRef, darkMode, isTKEnabled} = React.useContext(KoenigComposerContext);","+    // not this editor's own flag: in a card's nested editor that follows the card's edit mode","+    const isEditable = useIsDocumentEditable();"," ","     const isNested = !!editor._parentEditor;","     const isDragReorderEnabled = isDragEnabled && !readOnly && !isNested;","@@ -108,7 +111,8 @@ const KoenigComposableEditor = ({","             {!isCollabActive && <HistoryPlugin externalHistoryState={historyState} />} {/* adds undo/redo, in multiplayer that's handled by yjs */}","             <KoenigBehaviourPlugin containerElem={editorContainerRef} cursorDidExitAtTop={cursorDidExitAtTop} isNested={isNested} />","             <MarkdownShortcutPlugin transformers={markdownTransformers} />","-            {floatingAnchorElem && (<FloatingToolbarPlugin anchorElem={floatingAnchorElem} hiddenFormats={hiddenFormats} isSnippetsEnabled={isSnippetsEnabled} />)}","+            {/* formatting changes the document, which a read-only editor must not offer */}","+            {isEditable && floatingAnchorElem && (<FloatingToolbarPlugin anchorElem={floatingAnchorElem} hiddenFormats={hiddenFormats} isSnippetsEnabled={isSnippetsEnabled} />)}","             <DragDropPastePlugin />","             {registerAPI ? <ExternalControlPlugin registerAPI={registerAPI} /> : null}","             {isDragReorderEnabled && <DragDropReorderPlugin containerElem={editorContainerRef} />}"],"additions":5,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/src/components/ui/GifPlugin.tsx","lines":["@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@ import React from 'react';"," import {DELETE_CARD_COMMAND} from '../../plugins/KoenigBehaviourPlugin.jsx';"," import {INSERT_FROM_GIF_COMMAND} from '../../plugins/KoenigSelectorPlugin.jsx';"," import {getGifProviderConfig, useGif} from '../../utils/services/gif.js';","+import {useIsDocumentEditable} from '../../hooks/useIsDocumentEditable';"," import {useLexicalComposerContext} from '@lexical/react/LexicalComposerContext';"," "," const GifPlugin = ({nodeKey}) => {","@@ -11,6 +12,7 @@ const GifPlugin = ({nodeKey}) => {","     const providerConfig = getGifProviderConfig(cardConfig);","     const gifHook = useGif({config: providerConfig});","     const [editor] = useLexicalComposerContext();","+    const isEditable = useIsDocumentEditable();"," ","     React.useEffect(() => {","         const handleKeyDown = (e) => {","@@ -37,6 +39,11 @@ const GifPlugin = ({nodeKey}) => {","         editor.dispatchCommand(INSERT_FROM_GIF_COMMAND, image);","     };"," ","+    // closing the selector removes its card and picking a gif fills it","+    if (!isEditable) {","+        return null;","+    }","+","     return (","         <GifSelector","             onClickOutside={onClickOutside}"],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/src/components/ui/SnippetActionToolbar.tsx","lines":["@@ -6,12 +6,14 @@ import {SELECT_CARD_COMMAND} from '../../plugins/KoenigBehaviourPlugin.jsx';"," import {SnippetInput} from './SnippetInput';"," import {useKoenigSelectedCardContext} from '../../context/KoenigSelectedCardContext.jsx';"," import {useLexicalComposerContext} from '@lexical/react/LexicalComposerContext';","+import {useResetWhenReadOnly} from '../../hooks/useIsDocumentEditable';"," "," export function SnippetActionToolbar({onClose, ...props}) {","     const {cardConfig: {snippets, createSnippet}, darkMode} = React.useContext(KoenigComposerContext);","     const [editor] = useLexicalComposerContext();","     const {selectedCardKey} = useKoenigSelectedCardContext();","     const [value, setValue] = React.useState('');","+    useResetWhenReadOnly(() => onClose?.());"," ","     const handleChange = (event) => {","         setValue(event.target.value);"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/src/components/ui/UnsplashPlugin.tsx","lines":["@@ -4,12 +4,14 @@ import UnsplashModal from './file-selectors/UnsplashModal.jsx';"," import generateEditorState from '../../utils/generateEditorState';"," import {$createNodeSelection, $getNodeByKey, $setSelection} from 'lexical';"," import {$isKoenigCard} from '@tryghost/kg-default-nodes';","+import {useIsDocumentEditable} from '../../hooks/useIsDocumentEditable';"," import {useLexicalComposerContext} from '@lexical/react/LexicalComposerContext';"," "," const UnsplashPlugin = ({nodeKey, isModalOpen = true}) => {","     const {cardConfig} = React.useContext(KoenigComposerContext);","     const [editor] = useLexicalComposerContext();","     const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = React.useState(isModalOpen);","+    const isEditable = useIsDocumentEditable();"," ","     const onClose = () => {","         if (nodeKey) {","@@ -43,7 +45,8 @@ const UnsplashPlugin = ({nodeKey, isModalOpen = true}) => {","         setIsOpen(false);","     };"," ","-    if (!isOpen) {","+    // closing the selector removes its card and picking an image fills it","+    if (!isOpen || !isEditable) {","         return null;","     }"," "],"additions":4,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/src/hooks/useIsDocumentEditable.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,75 @@","+import React from 'react';","+import {useLexicalComposerContext} from '@lexical/react/LexicalComposerContext';","+import type {LexicalEditor} from 'lexical';","+","+function topLevelEditor(editor: LexicalEditor): LexicalEditor {","+    let topLevel = editor;","+    while (topLevel._parentEditor) {","+        topLevel = topLevel._parentEditor;","+    }","+    return topLevel;","+}","+","+// the top-level editor's flag says whether the document can change. A nested editor's","+// own flag follows its card's edit mode, so it says nothing about the document","+export function isDocumentEditable(editor: LexicalEditor): boolean {","+    return topLevelEditor(editor).isEditable();","+}","+","+export function useIsDocumentEditable(): boolean {","+    const [editor] = useLexicalComposerContext();","+    const topLevel = topLevelEditor(editor);","+","+    const subscribe = React.useCallback((onChange: () => void) => {","+        return topLevel.registerEditableListener(onChange);","+    }, [topLevel]);","+","+    return React.useSyncExternalStore(subscribe, () => topLevel.isEditable());","+}","+","+// Lexical copies the top-level flag to every nested editor when it changes, so a card puts its","+// editors back to its edit mode, or a closed card would be typable once editable again","+export function useEditModeAfterReadOnly(isEditing: boolean, ...editors: LexicalEditor[]): void {","+    const [editor] = useLexicalComposerContext();","+    const topLevel = topLevelEditor(editor);","+    const latest = React.useRef({isEditing, editors});","+","+    React.useLayoutEffect(() => {","+        latest.current = {isEditing, editors};","+    });","+","+    React.useEffect(() => {","+        return topLevel.registerEditableListener((isEditable) => {","+            if (!isEditable) {","+                return;","+            }","+","+            // once every listener has run, Lexical's own among them","+            queueMicrotask(() => {","+                if (!topLevel.isEditable()) {","+                    return;","+                }","+                for (const nested of latest.current.editors) {","+                    nested.setEditable(latest.current.isEditing);","+                }","+            });","+        });","+    }, [topLevel]);","+}","+","+// state in a card that only a later mousedown would close, such as an open","+// picker or name field, or it would be back once the editor is editable again","+export function useResetWhenReadOnly(reset: () => void): void {","+    const isEditable = useIsDocumentEditable();","+    const latest = React.useRef(reset);","+","+    React.useLayoutEffect(() => {","+        latest.current = reset;","+    });","+","+    React.useEffect(() => {","+        if (!isEditable) {","+            latest.current();","+        }","+    }, [isEditable]);","+}"],"additions":75,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/src/hooks/usePinturaEditor.ts","lines":["@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@"," import trackEvent from '../utils/analytics';","+import {isDocumentEditable} from './useIsDocumentEditable';"," import {useCallback, useEffect, useRef, useState} from 'react';","+import {useLexicalComposerContext} from '@lexical/react/LexicalComposerContext';"," "," export default function usePinturaEditor({","     config, disabled = false","@@ -7,6 +9,7 @@ export default function usePinturaEditor({","     const [scriptLoaded, setScriptLoaded] = useState(false);","     const [cssLoaded, setCssLoaded] = useState(false);","     const allowClose = useRef(false);","+    const [lexicalEditor] = useLexicalComposerContext();"," ","     const isEnabled = !disabled && scriptLoaded && cssLoaded;"," ","@@ -138,12 +141,17 @@ export default function usePinturaEditor({","             });"," ","             editor.on('process', (result) => {","+                // the image editor is its own window, and can outlast an editable document","+                if (!isDocumentEditable(lexicalEditor)) {","+                    return;","+                }","+","                 // save edited image","                 handleSave(result.dest);","                 trackEvent('Image Edit Saved', {location: 'editor'});","             });","         }","-    }, [isEnabled]);","+    }, [isEnabled, lexicalEditor]);"," ","     useEffect(() => {","         const handleCloseClick = (event) => {"],"additions":9,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"koenig/koenig-lexical/src/nodes/BookmarkNodeComponent.tsx","lines":["@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ import {BookmarkCard} from '../components/ui/cards/BookmarkCard.jsx';"," import {CardSettingsPanel} from '../components/CardSettingsPanel';"," import {SnippetActionToolbar} from '../components/ui/SnippetActionToolbar.jsx';"," import {ToolbarMenu, ToolbarMenuItem, ToolbarMenuSeparator} from '../components/ui/ToolbarMenu.jsx';","+import {isDocumentEditable} from '../hooks/useIsDocumentEditable';"," import {isInte